    "CoiStatement": "Compliance with ethical standards This study was approved by the Committees for the Protection of Human Subjects at the Dartmouth College, Michigan State University, and University of Michigan. Conflict of interest BL is a research consultant to the Society for Assisted Reproductive Technology (SART). EW is under contract with SART to maintain the SART CORS database. MBB, JES, JPT, and CCC have no conflicts to declare.",
    "Article": {
      "Pagination": {"MedlinePgn": "191-200"},
      "PublicationTypeList": {"PublicationType": {
